# --- data hygiene: never publish these -------------------------------------------
# The MATLAB reference implementation, its runtime and any real patient imaging stay
# outside this repository. See README, "Provenance of the coefficient tables".
*.m
*.fig
*.exe
*.mp4
MATLAB_Runtime_*
MATLAB_Runtime_*.zip

# Patient / clinical imaging. The only DICOM that belongs here is the scrubbed
# dummy-patient fixture under data/DOSE_TARO/.
*.DCM
*.ima
*.IMA
*.nii
*.nii.gz
!data/DOSE_TARO/*.dcm

# Segmentation output and downloaded archives. Survey results under results/ ARE
# committed -- they are derived numbers the manuscript cites; the imaging they were
# derived from stays in the archive.
_ctdose_segmentation/
*.zip
tcia_downloads/
.tcia_work/

# --- python -----------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/

# --- editors / os ------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Internal submission and audit working documents. These stay on the author's disk:
# the submission kit carries the cover letter, reviewer-suggestion reasoning and a
# ranked list of fallback journals, and the audit reports catalogue defects found and
# fixed during preparation. None of it is needed to reproduce anything in the paper --
# docs/REPRODUCING_FIGURES.md and results/ cover that -- and all of it is awkward to
# have public while the manuscript is under review.
paper/jacmp_submission_kit.md
paper/Scientific_Audit_Report*.md
docs/HANDOFF_*.md
docs/NEXT_STEPS_*.md
